WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.523 --> 00:00:04.690
- There is so much of knowledge
available today instantly.

00:00:05.623 --> 00:00:08.110
Bold decisions are not free of risk.

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:11.029
So they should analyze
the risk very carefully.

00:00:11.029 --> 00:00:14.712
Being responsible is vital to
a company's long term success.

00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:18.005
My goalpost keeps on changing
as we move forward in life.

00:00:18.005 --> 00:00:21.452
During the crisis and
post-crisis, always there has been

00:00:21.452 --> 00:00:23.755
and there will be exciting opportunities.

00:00:23.755 --> 00:00:26.119
First of all, you have to have
a commitment, dedication, and

00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:27.448
passion for what you are doing.

00:00:27.448 --> 00:00:30.031
One day I realized that
I am getting ready to go.

00:00:30.031 --> 00:00:32.618
We could be born with the baldness

00:00:32.618 --> 00:00:34.413
nor with the poor less.

00:00:34.413 --> 00:00:37.176
And this is not only
tragic, but not acceptable.

00:00:37.176 --> 00:00:40.223
If we have to grow, we have
to do something differently

00:00:40.223 --> 00:00:43.042
than what everyone else has been doing.

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:46.009
- He's an Indian steel magnate
based in the United Kingdom.

00:00:46.009 --> 00:00:48.412
- He's the chairman and
CEO of the world's largest

00:00:48.412 --> 00:00:49.776
steel-making company.

00:00:49.776 --> 00:00:52.694
- As of December 2015,
he was listed by Forbes

00:00:52.694 --> 00:00:56.104
to have a net worth of
$9.5 billion dollars.

00:00:56.104 --> 00:00:57.953
- He's Lakshmi Mittal and here are

00:00:57.953 --> 00:01:00.370
his top 10 rules for success.

00:01:02.793 --> 00:01:06.960
- There is so much of knowledge
available today instantly.

00:01:09.639 --> 00:01:12.490
And knowledge is the key.

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:16.490
If you have the knowledge,
if you have ambition.

00:01:17.579 --> 00:01:20.527
If you are determined, if you are focused.

00:01:20.527 --> 00:01:22.496
If you are committed.

00:01:22.496 --> 00:01:24.746
Use this knowledge to grow.

00:01:26.221 --> 00:01:29.625
Everyone can do it and this is what

00:01:29.625 --> 00:01:32.904
I would like to say to
all young men in India.

00:01:32.904 --> 00:01:37.071
I say bold decisions have
to be very transformative.

00:01:39.802 --> 00:01:41.635
And it has to succeed.

00:01:43.174 --> 00:01:46.507
And bold decisions are not easy to take.

00:01:48.193 --> 00:01:52.298
So these young people have
to have a lot of experience.

00:01:52.298 --> 00:01:54.175
They have to have determination.

00:01:54.175 --> 00:01:55.912
They have to have a commitment.

00:01:55.912 --> 00:02:00.044
And they have to think through
those issues very carefully.

00:02:00.044 --> 00:02:02.939
Bold decisions are not free of risk,

00:02:02.939 --> 00:02:06.275
so they should analyze
the risk very carefully.

00:02:06.275 --> 00:02:09.695
But definitely bold decisions could be

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:11.766
a very transformative decision

00:02:11.766 --> 00:02:13.099
in the business.

00:02:15.104 --> 00:02:19.165
I would encourage young
people to continue to analyze

00:02:19.165 --> 00:02:22.826
their situation and make bold
decisions because otherwise

00:02:22.826 --> 00:02:27.041
you cannot make a step
change in your career.

00:02:27.041 --> 00:02:28.947
Being responsible is is vital to

00:02:28.947 --> 00:02:31.096
a company's long term success.

00:02:31.096 --> 00:02:34.228
I have always believed this
because being responsible

00:02:34.228 --> 00:02:36.476
not only has benefits for society,

00:02:36.476 --> 00:02:39.369
it has clear benefits for the business.

00:02:39.369 --> 00:02:41.245
Let me give you two examples.

00:02:41.245 --> 00:02:43.849
First our success in reducing our

00:02:43.849 --> 00:02:46.982
own emissions has cost-benefits.

00:02:46.982 --> 00:02:50.131
Secondly, in developing
new and innovative products

00:02:50.131 --> 00:02:54.674
we help our customers
improve their performance

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:58.365
and we maintain our
market leading positions.

00:02:58.365 --> 00:03:01.910
- Did you ever foresee the
kind of success you've had?

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:06.077
When you were in Indonesia,
did you ever foresee it?

00:03:07.297 --> 00:03:10.267
- I never expected that we would be here.

00:03:10.267 --> 00:03:14.619
And I'm not a person who
sets very high goals.

00:03:14.619 --> 00:03:16.078
- You don't set high goals?

00:03:16.078 --> 00:03:18.657
- My goalpost keeps on changing as we move

00:03:18.657 --> 00:03:19.807
forward in the life.

00:03:19.807 --> 00:03:23.200
Then you're not very disappointed
if you don't succeed.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.723
- It's always been one step forward.

00:03:26.723 --> 00:03:30.450
- Always make a small step forward and you

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:32.950
become stronger in confidence.

00:03:33.848 --> 00:03:36.234
Then you change your goalpost.

00:03:36.234 --> 00:03:39.133
So it gives you more pleasure
than setting up a very high

00:03:39.133 --> 00:03:41.335
goal when you don't reach them.

00:03:41.335 --> 00:03:44.421
- I don't think we ever
talked of moving forward

00:03:44.421 --> 00:03:46.589
more than a year ahead.

00:03:46.589 --> 00:03:47.807
- Is that right?

00:03:47.807 --> 00:03:49.819
- For the last couple of
years, we have been thinking

00:03:49.819 --> 00:03:52.041
more 5 year strategy or 10 year strategy.

00:03:52.041 --> 00:03:54.169
- Yeah, I'm talking of those days.

00:03:54.169 --> 00:03:58.749
- In the beginning, do
a more short-term view.

00:03:58.749 --> 00:04:02.916
This challenging time gives
us a lot of experience.

00:04:03.994 --> 00:04:05.823
There are two kinds of situations.

00:04:05.823 --> 00:04:08.297
One, what are the bold decisions we

00:04:08.297 --> 00:04:10.495
could have taken in the crisis?

00:04:10.495 --> 00:04:13.400
And a lot of companies took
the opportunity of taking

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:17.358
bold decisions during a
crisis and reshaped their

00:04:17.358 --> 00:04:19.822
business model for the future.

00:04:19.822 --> 00:04:22.944
They have skimmed off some of the excess,

00:04:22.944 --> 00:04:25.700
they've reduced their cost,
they have flexibilized

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:28.065
their fixed costs and expenses.

00:04:28.065 --> 00:04:30.680
They have started
spending a lot of money on

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:33.458
innovation and for the future.

00:04:33.458 --> 00:04:36.391
They have started diversifying
to emerging markets.

00:04:36.391 --> 00:04:38.901
There has been a lot
of bold decisions taken

00:04:38.901 --> 00:04:41.176
during the crisis.

00:04:41.176 --> 00:04:45.221
And in most crisis, I see
that companies need to take

00:04:45.221 --> 00:04:48.164
bold decisions to design
their business model for the

00:04:48.164 --> 00:04:51.646
next 20 years, looking
at the growth areas,

00:04:51.646 --> 00:04:53.509
looking at opportunities.

00:04:53.509 --> 00:04:57.105
So, I believe that during the
crisis and post-crisis, always

00:04:57.105 --> 00:05:00.910
there has been and there will
be exciting opportunities.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:03.193
This really goes back to
when I was 16 years old.

00:05:03.193 --> 00:05:07.360
I passed my Hindi schooling,
then applied for admission

00:05:08.977 --> 00:05:10.310
in St. Xavier's.

00:05:11.672 --> 00:05:15.103
Since I came from Hindi school,
Father Julius at the time

00:05:15.103 --> 00:05:18.541
was the principal, felt
that I would not be able

00:05:18.541 --> 00:05:21.127
to fit in English medium college,

00:05:21.127 --> 00:05:24.315
though I was top in my class in school.

00:05:24.315 --> 00:05:28.068
I got admission into other
colleges, but I really wanted

00:05:28.068 --> 00:05:32.418
to study in St. Xavier's,
so I kept on knocking

00:05:32.418 --> 00:05:36.285
on his door everyday, till
he finally gave it up.

00:05:36.285 --> 00:05:39.407
And I promised him that I
would be a good student.

00:05:39.407 --> 00:05:42.657
- And how did this experience shape you

00:05:43.717 --> 00:05:45.113
as a business person?

00:05:45.113 --> 00:05:47.783
Breaking down doors, breaking
ceilings, is that something

00:05:47.783 --> 00:05:49.896
you learned at St. Xavier's?

00:05:49.896 --> 00:05:53.285
- I found it a challenge for
me to prove Fr. Julius wrong,

00:05:53.285 --> 00:05:56.121
that coming from Hindi
medium school cannot

00:05:56.121 --> 00:05:58.984
do well in English medium college.

00:05:58.984 --> 00:06:03.244
And that challenge really
gave me a lot of learnings.

00:06:03.244 --> 00:06:08.179
I determined myself that I
would prove him wrong and I

00:06:08.179 --> 00:06:12.194
really dedicated myself, committed
to myself, that I have to

00:06:12.194 --> 00:06:15.697
accept this challenge and
continue to work hard, focus on

00:06:15.697 --> 00:06:17.888
the studies, and this is a good learning

00:06:17.888 --> 00:06:19.919
in the business life.

00:06:19.919 --> 00:06:22.128
That, first of all, you have
to have commitment, dedication,

00:06:22.128 --> 00:06:24.768
and passion for what you are doing.

00:06:24.768 --> 00:06:28.409
I just said everyone works
hard, but something needs to

00:06:28.409 --> 00:06:32.031
differentiate yourself
with some others, is focus,

00:06:32.031 --> 00:06:35.683
dedication, commitment,
and continue to work hard.

00:06:35.683 --> 00:06:39.182
- I don't like to get
addicted to any one hobby.

00:06:39.182 --> 00:06:40.595
- Okay.

00:06:40.595 --> 00:06:43.245
- For example, I started playing golf.

00:06:43.245 --> 00:06:45.495
I like it, I like it a lot.

00:06:46.337 --> 00:06:50.429
Everyday in the morning
I would go and practice.

00:06:50.429 --> 00:06:53.231
One day I realized that I
am getting addicted to golf.

00:06:53.231 --> 00:06:57.749
So one day in the morning I
was driving to golf course

00:06:57.749 --> 00:07:02.011
and suddenly I realized
that this is not right.

00:07:02.011 --> 00:07:04.304
So I turned back the car

00:07:04.304 --> 00:07:06.069
and since then I never played again.

00:07:06.069 --> 00:07:07.959
- So you don't have any addictions?

00:07:07.959 --> 00:07:09.178
- I don't like addiction.

00:07:09.178 --> 00:07:13.280
I think it could distract
me from my focus.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.482
- We are not born with the poorness.

00:07:16.482 --> 00:07:18.942
We could be born with the boldness,

00:07:18.942 --> 00:07:20.779
not with the poorness.

00:07:20.779 --> 00:07:24.946
It is not that something only
you learn from education.

00:07:26.857 --> 00:07:29.357
Education is only one enabler.

00:07:30.292 --> 00:07:32.496
But you have to have experience,

00:07:32.496 --> 00:07:36.502
you have to have experience of success,

00:07:36.502 --> 00:07:40.015
which means you gain some confidence.

00:07:40.015 --> 00:07:43.265
Then you have to have your small goals,

00:07:44.723 --> 00:07:47.343
small goals set up in your life,

00:07:47.343 --> 00:07:50.953
and if you succeed, if
you think that you are

00:07:50.953 --> 00:07:52.907
more confident than before,

00:07:52.907 --> 00:07:56.634
you want to take bold
decisions in the future.

00:07:56.634 --> 00:07:59.995
I will always be concerned
about health and safety

00:07:59.995 --> 00:08:03.147
until we reach the place of zero accidents

00:08:03.147 --> 00:08:04.814
and zero fatalities.

00:08:05.712 --> 00:08:07.548
There are very number of fatalities again

00:08:07.548 --> 00:08:12.270
in 2012 and this is not only
tragic but not acceptable.

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:15.793
We have to remain dedicated
to addressing this problem.

00:08:15.793 --> 00:08:18.870
I want our senior leaders
to lead by example.

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:23.744
That's why I have asked my
colleagues on GB and MMC

00:08:23.744 --> 00:08:26.058
to spend more time on the show floor

00:08:26.058 --> 00:08:29.175
and promote increased
training and awareness

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:32.366
for both our employees
and our contractors.

00:08:32.366 --> 00:08:35.800
This is how we will drive
further improvement.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:39.967
I was in talk show with other
business man from India.

00:08:41.469 --> 00:08:44.279
When I was talking to him I realized

00:08:44.279 --> 00:08:46.946
that a condition is way to grow.

00:08:48.393 --> 00:08:51.807
I realized that life is very short

00:08:51.807 --> 00:08:53.729
and if you have to really do something,

00:08:53.729 --> 00:08:56.062
you have to do very quickly.

00:08:57.473 --> 00:09:01.174
If you have to grow, you have
to do something differently

00:09:01.174 --> 00:09:03.934
than what everyone else has been doing.

00:09:03.934 --> 00:09:07.498
I started thinking, if I
start building this tea plant

00:09:07.498 --> 00:09:09.866
it would take years.

00:09:09.866 --> 00:09:12.143
How many of these tea plants,

00:09:12.143 --> 00:09:14.025
how many companies you can build.

00:09:14.025 --> 00:09:17.150
If I have to succeed in my life,

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:21.072
I have to find a formula
which is different.

00:09:21.072 --> 00:09:25.239
Which keeps me ahead of my
competition and my colleagues.

00:09:27.502 --> 00:09:31.049
That's how I thought that
we should acquire companies,

00:09:31.049 --> 00:09:34.716
merge, consolidate them,
reduce their costs,

00:09:36.764 --> 00:09:39.125
make them very efficient.

00:09:39.125 --> 00:09:42.178
- And a turnaround became like a science.

00:09:42.178 --> 00:09:44.305
- I would say that, yeah,

00:09:44.305 --> 00:09:48.472
science and art, it is a
mixture of science and art.

00:09:51.281 --> 00:09:53.992
Every company has different issue.

00:09:53.992 --> 00:09:57.890
It's not that there is a
formula which you apply.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:09:59.092
- You can apply on everyone?

00:09:59.092 --> 00:10:01.299
- Yeah, it is not controlled water here.

00:10:01.299 --> 00:10:03.572
- But the pattern, you
establish this pattern

00:10:03.572 --> 00:10:06.222
and you applied it in different countries,

00:10:06.222 --> 00:10:07.194
different markets.

00:10:07.194 --> 00:10:08.093
- Yes.

00:10:08.093 --> 00:10:09.731
- And that was the genesis of your empire.

00:10:09.731 --> 00:10:10.727
- Yes.

00:10:10.727 --> 00:10:12.000
- Thank you so much for watching.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.437
- We made this video because
John Simon asked up to.

00:10:14.437 --> 00:10:16.178
If you have a famous entrepreneur

00:10:16.178 --> 00:10:17.611
you'd like a video made of,

00:10:17.611 --> 00:10:19.089
leave a comment below.

00:10:19.089 --> 00:10:21.166
- I'd also love to know
which of the top 10 rules

00:10:21.166 --> 00:10:23.279
meant the most to you,
had the biggest impact

00:10:23.279 --> 00:10:25.293
on you today, leave it in the comments,

00:10:25.293 --> 00:10:26.462
we'll join in the discussion.

00:10:26.462 --> 00:10:27.729
Thank you so much for watching,

00:10:27.729 --> 00:10:28.646
continue to believe,

00:10:28.646 --> 00:10:30.563
and we'll see you soon.

